ொன்","parts":[{"text":"பிறிதொன்","lemma":"பிறிதொன்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true}],"as_printed":true},{"words":[{"surface":"றறியாற்","parts":[{"text":"றறியாற்","lemma":"றறியாற்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"குரைப்பலோ","parts":[{"text":"குரைப்பலோ","lemma":"குரைப்பலோ","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"யானே","parts":[{"text":"யானே","lemma":"யானே","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"யெய்த்தவிப்","parts":[{"text":"யெய்த்தவிப்","lemma":"யெய்த்தவிப்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true}],"as_printed":true},{"words":[{"surface":"பணையெழின்","parts":[{"text":"பணையெழின்","lemma":"பணையெழின்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"மென்றோ","parts":[{"text":"மென்றோ","lemma":"மென்றோ","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"ளணைஇய","parts":[{"text":"ளணைஇய","lemma":"ளணைஇய","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"வந்நாட்","parts":[{"text":"வந்நாட்","lemma":"வந்நாட்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true}],"as_printed":true},{"words":[{"surface":"பிழையா","parts":[{"text":"பிழை","lemma":"பிழை","gloss":"fail"},{"text":"ஆ","lemma":"ஆ","gloss":"negative relative participle suffix"}],"gloss":"unfailing"},{"surface":"வஞ்சினம்","parts":[{"text":"வஞ்சினம்","lemma":"வஞ்சினம்","gloss":"vow"}],"gloss":"vow"},{"surface":"செய்த","parts":[{"text":"செய்","lemma":"செய்","gloss":"do"},{"text":"த","lemma":"அ","gloss":"relative participle suffix"}],"gloss":"who made"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"கள்வனும்","parts":[{"text":"கள்வன்","lemma":"கள்வன்","gloss":"thief"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"உம்","gloss":"and"}],"gloss":"the thief and"},{"surface":"கடவனும்","parts":[{"text":"கடவன்","lemma":"கடவன்","gloss":"one duty-bound"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"உம்","gloss":"and"}],"gloss":"the one duty-bound and"},{"surface":"புனைவனும்","parts":[{"text":"புனைவன்","lemma":"புனைவன்","gloss":"decorator"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"உம்","gloss":"and"}],"gloss":"the decorator and"},{"surface":"தானே","parts":[{"text":"தான்","lemma":"தான்","gloss":"himself"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"emphasis"}],"gloss":"himself indeed"}]}],"literal":"Of the striking sharks bustled shining water's expanse / fragrant flowers of ஞாழல் with புன்னை having spread / like the frenzy-performing arena appearing shore's lord / even if he does not intend, or even if he intends, other one / to him who does not know shall I tell, I indeed? Grown thin / these bamboo-like beautiful soft shoulders embraced that day / unfailing vow made / thief and duty-bound one and decorator himself indeed!","translation":"On the expanse of shining waters where striking sharks swarm, the fragrant flowers of the gnarled gnāḻal and punnai trees spread, making the shore look like an arena where the frenzied Veri dance is performed. Even if the lord of that shore does not intend to marry me, or even if he does, should I go and tell my mother, who knows nothing of this? On that day, he embraced these beautiful, soft, bamboo-like shoulders of mine, which have now grown thin, and made an unfailing vow. He is the thief who stole my heart, the one duty-bound to marry me, and the one who will adorn me as his bride!","modern":"தாக்கும் சுறா மீன்கள் நிறைந்த, விளங்கும் கடல் பரப்பில், நறிய மலர்களைக் கொண்ட ஞாழல் மரங்களும் புன்னை மரங்களும் மலர்களை உதிர்த்துப் பரப்பியுள்ளன. அது வெறியாடும் களம் போலத் தோன்றும் கடற்கரைத் துறைக்குத் தலைவன் ஆவான். அவன் என்னை மணக்க நினையாதவனாயினும், அல்லது நினைப்பவனாயினும், இதனைப் பற்றி ஏதும் அறியாத என் தாயிடம் நான் எவ்வாறு கூறுவேன்? மெலிந்துபோன என் மூங்கில் போன்ற அழகிய மெல்லிய தோள்களைத் தழுவிய அந்நாளில், அவன் பொய்க்காத சூளுரை உரைத்தான். அவனே என் நெஞ்சைக் கவர்ந்த கள்வனும், என்னை மணக்க வேண்டிய கடப்பாடு உடையவனும், என்னை மணக்கோலத்தால் அலங்கரிக்க வேண்டியவனும் ஆவான்.","explanation":"The heroine is speaking to her friend (or to herself) about the hero's delay in marrying her. She describes the coastal landscape (neytal) where the fallen flowers of gnāḻal and punnai trees make the shore look like a ritual ground for the frenzied Veri dance. This image of the Veri ground hints at her mother's worry and the threat of performing a ritual to cure her pining, which is actually caused by her love. She recalls the day the hero embraced her beautiful, bamboo-like shoulders and made a solemn, unfailing vow. She declares that he is the thief who stole her beauty, the one duty-bound to marry her, and the only one who can adorn her as his bride.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.4,0.7],[0.7,0.9],[0.9,1.7],[1.7,2.24],[2.24,2.57],[3.0,3.4],[3.4,3.6],[3.6,3.84],[3.84,4.59],[4.59,5.2],[5.2,5.6],[5.6,6.2],[6.2,6.87],[6.87,7.4],[7.4,8.2],[8.2,8.36],[8.69,9.5],[9.5,9.9],[9.9,10.15],[10.15,10.9],[10.9,11.7],[11.7,12.18],[12.18,12.49],[12.49,12.8],[12.8,13.03],[13.03,13.2],[13.2,14.9],[14.9,15.9],[15.9,16.4],[16.4,16.9],[16.9,17.1]],"female":[[0.0,0.9],[0.9,1.3],[1.3,2.0],[2.0,3.12],[3.12,3.8],[3.8,4.4],[4.4,4.7],[4.7,5.5],[5.5,6.41],[6.41,7.2],[7.2,7.6],[9.15,9.67],[9.67,10.06],[10.06,10.58],[10.58,11.35],[11.35,11.87],[11.87,12.39],[12.39,13.04],[13.04,13.3],[13.3,13.95],[13.95,14.5],[14.57,14.88],[14.88,15.3],[15.45,15.6],[15.6,16.23],[16.23,17.27],[17.27,17.9],[17.9,18.93],[18.93,19.96],[19.96,20.3],[20.3,20.6]]},"sync":[[["எறிசுறா","striking shark"]],[["கலித்த","bustled"]],[["இலங்கு","shining"],["நீர்","water"],["பரப்பின்","of the expanse"]],[["பரப்பின்","of the expanse"]],[["நறுவீ","fragrant flowers"]],[["ஞாழலொடு","with the ஞாழல் trees"]],[["புன்னை","mastwood trees"]],[["தாஅய்","having spread"]],[["வெறி","fragrance"],["அயர்","performing"]],[["களத்தினில்","in the arena"]],[["தோன்றும்","appearing"]],[["துறைவன்","lord of the shore"]],[["குறியா",""]],[["னாயினும்",""]],[["குறிப்பினும்",""]],[["பிறிதொன்",""]],[["றறியாற்",""]],[["குரைப்பலோ",""]],[["யானே",""]],[["யெய்த்தவிப்",""]],[["பணையெழின்",""]],[["மென்றோ",""]],[["ளணைஇய",""]],[["வந்நாட்",""]],[["பிழையா","unfailing"]],[["வஞ்சினம்","vow"]],[["செய்த","who made"]],[["கள்வனும்","the thief and"]],[["கடவனும்","the one duty-bound and"]],[["புனைவனும்","the decorator and"]],[["தானே","himself indeed"]]]}